            <!-- WHO WE ARE SECTION END -->
            
            <!-- MANUFACTURING FACILITY SECTION START -->
            <div class="section-full p-t80 p-b50 bg-white">
                <div class="container">
                    <div class="section-content">
                        <div class="row d-flex align-items-center">
                            <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-12 m-b30">
                                <div class="section-head">
                                    <h2>Our Manufacturing Facility</h2>
                                </div>
                                <p>All production phases – design, fabrication, assembly, packaging and back-office coordination – are managed from our registered office and manufacturing plant located at <strong>Sundar–Raiwind Road, Lahore</strong>.</p>
                                <p>This local presence means shorter lead times, controlled quality and responsive support for Pakistani clients.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-12 m-b30">
                                <div class="wt-media">
                                    <img src="images/about-pic1.jpg" alt="Pak Gusu Manufacturing Facility">
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- MANUFACTURING FACILITY SECTION END -->
            
            <!-- CLEANROOM CLASSIFICATIONS SECTION START -->
            <div class="section-full p-t80 p-b50 bg-gray">
                <div class="container">
                    <!-- TITLE START -->
                    <div class="section-head text-center">
                        <div class="wt-separator-outer separator-center">
                            <div class="wt-separator">
                                <span class="site-text-primary text-uppercase sep-line-one ">Cleanroom Standards</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <h2>Cleanroom Classifications – At a Glance</h2>
                    </div>
                    <!-- TITLE END -->
                    <div class="section-content">
                        <div class="row">
                            <div class="col-lg-12 m-b30">
                                <p>Cleanrooms are classified based on how clean the air is, measured by the number and size of particles in a given volume of air. Internationally, standards such as <strong>ISO 14644-1</strong> and historically <strong>Federal Standard 209E</strong> define cleanliness classes (e.g. ISO 5, ISO 7, ISO 8) by maximum allowable particle counts.</p>
                                <p class="m-t20">Pak Gusu designs cleanroom envelopes and components to help you achieve and maintain these classifications through:</p>
                                <ul class="list-angle-right p-t15">
                                    <li>Proper zoning and pressure cascades</li>
                                    <li>Suitable panel and ceiling systems</li>
                                    <li>Correct positioning of doors, windows and transfer hatches</li>
                                    <li>Integration with HVAC and filtration design (in collaboration with your HVAC specialists where required)</li>
                                </ul>
                                <a href="about/cleanroom-classifications/index.html" class="site-button m-t20">Learn More About Classifications</a>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- CLEANROOM CLASSIFICATIONS SECTION END -->
        
            <!-- SECTORS SECTION START -->
            <div class="section-full p-t80 p-b20 bg-white">
